---
---

<section id="services" class="services">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">Agricultural Support & Management</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">農業指導・管理サービス</h2>

    <p class="services-lead">
      農業経験がない方でも安心して始められるよう、農業指導員の常駐と管理代行サービスを構想しています。
      週末だけ来て、気軽に土に触れるための仕組みです。
    </p>

    <div class="service-photo">
      <img
        src="/service.png"
        alt="農業指導・管理サービスのイメージ"
        class="service-photo-img"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="services-table">
      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-head">
          <span class="service-tag">A</span>
          <h3>基本管理サービス</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="service-items">
          <li>共用部・共同管理棟・小公園の維持管理</li>
          <li>共用設備の清掃・保守</li>
          <li>防犯・巡回対応</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="service-note">各区画内部の維持管理は原則として所有者が行う想定です（分譲地）。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-row service-row--featured">
        <div class="service-head">
          <span class="service-tag">B</span>
          <h3>営農指導サービス</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="service-items">
          <li>作付け相談・家庭菜園計画の支援</li>
          <li>季節ごとの栽培アドバイス</li>
          <li>病害虫相談</li>
          <li>初心者向け講習</li>
          <li>必要資材の提案・販売</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="service-schedule">営業予定：月〜火・金〜日 / 日中帯（水・木休み）</p>
      </div>

      <div class="service-row">
        <div class="service-head">
          <span class="service-tag">C</span>
          <h3>菜園管理代行サービス（有料・構想）</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="service-items">
          <li>水やり・簡易除草</li>
          <li>病害虫の確認・報告</li>
          <li>収穫補助・状況報告</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="service-note">平日に現地へ来られない方向けの有料オプションとして構想中。料金体系は未定です。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="management-building">
      <span class="section-label" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">共同管理棟</span>
      <div class="building-items">
        <div class="building-item">
          <span class="building-item-label">農具保管</span>
          <p>農具・資材の共用保管スペース</p>
        </div>
        <div class="building-item">
          <span class="building-item-label">指導員設備</span>
          <p>農業指導員の常駐・相談対応設備</p>
        </div>
        <div class="building-item">
          <span class="building-item-label">小売販売</span>
          <p>農業用品・日用品の小規模販売</p>
        </div>
        <div class="building-item">
          <span class="building-item-label">駐車場</span>
          <p>共用駐車スペース（台数は未定）</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services {
    background: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .services-lead {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .service-photo {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .service-photo-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 360px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
    display: block;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .service-photo-img { height: 220px; }
  }

  .services-table {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .service-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg-white);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .service-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  .service-row--featured {
    background: var(--green-light);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
  }

  .service-head {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .service-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 1.6rem;
    height: 1.6rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .service-row--featured .service-tag {
    border-color: var(--green);
    color: var(--green);
    background: white;
  }

  .service-head h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .service-items {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    column-count: 1;
  }

  .service-items li {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .service-items li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.65em;
    width: 0.4rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--ink-faint);
  }

  .service-note {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .service-schedule {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--green-mid);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  /* Management building */
  .management-building {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--bg-white);
  }

  .building-items {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .building-item {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .building-item-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--earth);
    font-family: var(--mono);
  }

  .building-item p {
    font-size: 0.825rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .service-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .building-items {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .building-items { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
